ff.md (crosslink repo). Playbook §9 note committed on the ASES feature branch @ a0579c7c (playbook lives in the ASES repo, not crosslink).\n\nMANUAL VERIFICATION: crosslink kickoff run --dry-run --base feature/parent-phase printed 'Base: feature/parent-phase'; created worktree branch point == parent ref exactly (rev-parse equal); parent.txt present in worktree without merge; --base feature/nonexistent → exit 1 'Base ref ... does not exist. Valid refs: ...'; --branch feature/self-check --base feature/self-check → 'Refusing to branch ... from itself'.\n\nWHAT-NOT-TESTED: full 2898-test bin suite (OOM-killed on this memory-constrained host at ~600 tests — pre-existing environment issue, unrelated to the change; all kickoff/swarm/sentinel/cli_integration suites pass in isolation). Builder git-merge gating change, swarm phase base, CI changes — explicitly out of scope per issue.","created_at":"2026-08-08T08:23:09.940395127Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:SJ+ubvvx8CCKYLy/K/pn2Gd9cslQmp/rBwFVKBeWLo8","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgofsDNaXCDOrg4oVsNX9NaFZ9Hs0vMBM3jhfLhibuxsEAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAH45PSHVgo9uOEeaS16j9tYhbqJkHTIFi806gUQgYccF0rvwKK0JgOId+cCGt8lJcA+8Qil1mLFFYiwVA6lKbAg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:SJ+ubvvx8CCKYLy/K/pn2Gd9cslQmp/rBwFVKBeWLo8","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgofsDNaXCDOrg4oVsNX9NaFZ9Hs0vMBM3jhfLhibuxsEAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMfVGwIcKiVwc57LK0S9s+uWE5FFv0HGgRZ2mFZgddzxWl99PG3epT52IeVfvB7rrANaWgob+qtmkLtboPmPcwc="}
